{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f31443900eaa7e9d2108c866fed4d162c2167ab7445361b0d67a60caa3cceeff", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\n今、俺の名前を呼びませんでした？", "zh": "青羽小姐，你辛苦了。\n刚刚你是不是叫了我的名字？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "db8d8a3396fe86ee395a5bee2868070082fa77b946f461da9a6807a80cda3452", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nはい、お呼びしてました♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n对呀，我在找你喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "8f9817a9d95439f00793146e681751bd7c7dbfc99c1c0547fa13fd5c629d359b", "ja": "また社長さんからお呼び出しがあったんです。それで、\n私もお買い物ついでに、ご一緒しようかな～って……。", "zh": "社长又有事情要找你过去了。\n刚好我要出门买东西，想说要不要顺便和你一起去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "297c8f6d5c214a731f29245cb6623bae290c76cf3af32cce903ab935b31de668", "ja": "あああっ！", "zh": "啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c02d763b8c6c43f8205598ca1a432eb37bceab828c6973c6f492e76f28bf18b0", "ja": "ど、どうしました！？", "zh": "怎、怎么了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "e2699c13298bffc2482bc022e3e4dafcdd766fa3b5deac6684dedf1f3b78bdfc", "ja": "そういえば、もうすぐ実家から劇場宛に、スイカが\n届くんでした！　はう、まだ待ってなくちゃ……。", "zh": "我突然想起来，家里寄的西瓜就快送来剧场了！\n啊呜，我得继续在这里等才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "544ea66de3507c24f14d3d2cc7ac3b9c49c6f10213a388844e6fe9ab03b21a23", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}さん。\n今のお話は……なかったことに……。", "zh": "不好意思，{$P$}先生。\n一起出门这件事……还是先算了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b05e2d7ec88eac6b57b7a875fd66344c3b6448f8af05f16a2e4a552418a0b9f9", "ja": "わ、わかりました、また今度ということで。\nそれじゃ、とりあえず行ってきます！", "zh": "我、我知道了，那就等下次有机会吧。\n那我就先过去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "bfe311f69741f932efa80e5176f9e3e20d5c1ba5b94979d429e54fd0aeb52b93", "ja": "それじゃ、いってらしゃ～い！\nスイカと一緒に、待ってますね～♪", "zh": "好的，路上小心～！\n我会和西瓜一起等你回来的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0b8126471929445bc31e6c2b544fd8968eafc34d55d2e7f90a0cdf625c64ae3a", "ja": "失礼します。\n社長、話があると聞いたんですが……？", "zh": "打扰了。\n听说社长有事要找我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "e57d36332bfecaa87812074dd530fd51c04885b4c4aba2175773a5baa54616ba", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです、社長とお待ちしていましたよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了，社长在等你啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e81ef3b2de3bdcd410da7d4aca3db38e5aabc06441c5499dc33229b4421383ee", "ja": "音無さん、お疲れさまです！\n今日はどんな用事でしょうか？", "zh": "音无小姐，你也辛苦了！\n请问今天找我有什么事情呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "fde86c19829e4bf9e913a06fd0d7166da568b7dd722b6881981cb2cb99d029b4", "ja": "それは……そう、アイドルといえば夏！\n夏といえばアイドル！　というお話です♪", "zh": "这个嘛……没错，说到偶像就会想到夏天！\n说到夏天就会想到偶像！就是这么回事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cb977a14d160a79623b4c062043b0c580a5be8628adeeb63875dab12f925134d", "ja": "なるほど！　それはつまり……\nどういうことですか？", "zh": "原来如此！\n所以……究竟是怎么回事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "df312787a2d94a2f06586e89931cd0b1d7abf5c7849d494b520fd883909c9634", "ja": "はっはっは、音無君、夏らしい前フリをありがとう！\nさすが我が765プロが誇る、歴戦の事務員だ！", "zh": "哈哈哈！音无，谢谢你充满夏天气息的开场白！\n不愧是我们765艺能引以为傲，身经百战的事务员！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "87d2f9db8941728a71699b94a64871edda19facaad5b1a100d15411cc0642607", "ja": "まあ、社長ったらお上手なんですから！\n……え？　歴戦？", "zh": "哎呀，社长也真是的，嘴巴真甜！\n……等等？身经百战？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "63d7ce6b8963854761bdefe5897999b07590bce03e441dd7647d3c2fa89b5bc0", "ja": "さて、君！　よく来てくれたね！\n実は今日は、重大発表がある。", "zh": "好了！我就等着你过来！\n其实今天有件大事要发表。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "884c6c78976d917121217a5176e58526e49f9b2aba3182779c8ba454635c0178", "ja": "君は、アイドルサマーフェスティバル、\nという催しを知っているかね？", "zh": "你知道「偶像夏日祭」这个活动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "17b181d183a6692d6304145f20d82f3a1827c8353dcc415b443808b3bb1e7f4e", "ja": "アイドルサマーフェスティバルですか。\n聞いたことがあります。確か……。", "zh": "「偶像夏日祭」吗？\n我有听说过，记得是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "843423a667c7911f3faa7b7042c64a661715eb87caa7eef60ac2f61005f7b485", "ja": "通称アイサマ！　今をときめくアイドルたちが\n一堂に会する、ファン待望のビッグイベントですよね！", "zh": "俗称「偶夏」！时下人气偶像们齐聚一堂，\n让粉丝们引颈期盼的大型活动，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "b4ae214dbf4549675dec02f251c84e3a151608e3e0e94348d0df2a9c6e6ea5eb", "ja": "そうだ。そのアイサマから、我が765プロにも\n出演のオファーが届いたのだよ！", "zh": "没错，而这次我们765艺能，\n也在那个偶夏的工作邀约之列！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "66d5326e092d4f51f3ffc23185110af76615d12eb6191e1d852ad1ed8044f3f7", "ja": "おお、本当ですか！", "zh": "喔喔，真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "841a00f4c17ce3e925d2d46c4f6b758b2c47fdb514fb497ffd5d98d74168e96f", "ja": "主催からオファーがあったのは、天海春香君。\n加えて39プロジェクトから5名ほど、ということだ。", "zh": "主办单位发出工作邀约的有天海春香，\n另外再由39PROJECT派出5名成员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "c3b61761214ce7ae3792cf277d791a476f71a3f0790081053c17950dcecbd94a", "ja": "39プロジェクトからの選抜は、君に一任しようと\n思う！　どうだろう、引き受けてくれるかね？", "zh": "至于要从39PROJECT选拔的成员，我想全权由你负责！\n如何？你愿意接下这个任务吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_1025", "source_sha256": "b9651974dd46b4b0b61191e0de4bfcb9428141bf41b768751e920af2780cd7e7", "ja": "もちろんです", "zh": "当然愿意", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "67f6d04c9759281a75e622584dec15880c987d4f3a03cecf85bc9b80632d1193", "ja": "もちろんです！\nこちらからお願いしたいくらいですよ。", "zh": "当然愿意！\n我甚至还想毛遂自荐呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "217e760a21984039c2ba8dae0378e6c9a34fa71d9a0ee51c859e4a67c1b1d469", "ja": "いい返事だ！　では任せたよ。今回のイベントでも\n無論、アイドル諸君の活躍を願っているわけだが……", "zh": "答得好！那么就交给你了。\n在这次活动中，我当然希望偶像们也能大为活跃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "c92bd9d49bee1fb95f9bebbf4b602ba11dfc9d3850a27d4c94fb6c527a7bf224", "ja": "それ以上に、様々な人気アイドルたちとの出会いが、\n皆を成長させてくれると思っている。期待しているよ！", "zh": "但我更觉得与众多人气偶像的邂逅，\n将能刺激她们的成长。对此我很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "28e59a25e9b3a74de584c474efd4e89645af9360ede0bbf8c55c6279aa26c729", "ja": "夏といえば、出会いの季節ですからね！\nきっとみんな、ステキな経験ができるって思います♪", "zh": "夏天正是邂逅的季节呢！\n大家一定能获得很棒的经验♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_2004_president", "source_sha256": "0cff127e144900d331b7ed8f23b9c2955a56790033e930f32b1c2b47ba98cb34", "ja": "そういうことだよ音無君！\n彼女達の夏の成長を、楽しみにしていようじゃないか！", "zh": "一点也没错，音无！\n我们就好好期待她们在这个夏天能有多少成长吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "b66dcfc40198b2775f438348dbf3ed9f2316c5f58115fc2921f04ade29bd701f", "ja": "（よし……さっそく劇場に戻ろう。\n誰を選抜すべきか、しっかりと考えないとな！）", "zh": "（好……赶快回剧场去吧。\n要仔细思考该挑选谁去参加！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_2006_president", "source_sha256": "0c8d58cf3c8047e791fe97051f2e8eccac909835ffae0f38ae187a696e14ace7", "ja": "ああ、君、ちょっと待ってくれたまえ！\n……実はもうひとつ、君に伝えておくことがある。", "zh": "对了，你先别急，稍等一下！\n……其实我还有一件事情要告诉你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_2007_p", "source_sha256": "fff970dc416e9cd6b2e0053af3c2342ecf138f5910648904876df71028d9372a", "ja": "あ、はい。どうしました？", "zh": "啊，好的。是什么事情呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_intro_2008_president", "source_sha256": "e77165d2eb950baff305adc0a68a1b50fbc4c98fc103881d5cb8be41b1ac0a96", "ja": "様々な人気アイドルたちとの出会い、と言ったがね。\n実は、今年のアイサマには……。", "zh": "刚才我不是提到「与众多人气偶像的邂逅」吗？\n其实，今年的偶夏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
